layout: layouts/tool.njk
title: "SMS text message opt-in"
description: "Sign up to receive text messages from VoiceTel — product updates, account alerts, and promotional offers. Manage your SMS preferences."
---

<p class="eyebrow"><a href="/legal/">Legal</a> / SMS opt-in</p>
<h1>Sign up for VoiceTel text messages.</h1>
<p class="lede">Opt in to receive recurring SMS messages from VoiceTel, including product updates, account alerts, and promotional offers. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.</p>

<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Opt in</h2>
	<p>Enter your name and mobile number. Check the consent box to confirm you want to receive text messages from VoiceTel.</p>

	<form id="sms-optin-form" action="{{ site.portalUrl }}{{ site.formEndpoints.smsOptin }}" data-fallback-url="/contact/" method="post" class="form-grid full-width">
		<div class="form-row">
			<label for="sms-optin-name">Name <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
			<input id="sms-optin-name" name="name" type="text" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name">
		</div>
		<div class="form-row">
			<label for="sms-optin-phone">Mobile number <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
			<input id="sms-optin-phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="(555) 123-4567">
		</div>
		<div class="form-row form-row--full">
			<label class="consent-label">
				<input id="sms-optin-consent" name="consent" type="checkbox" required value="yes">
				<span class="consent-text">I agree to receive recurring text messages from VoiceTel at the mobile number provided, including product updates, account alerts, and promotional offers. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to cancel or HELP for help. Consent is not a condition of purchase. View our <a href="/legal/#privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/legal/#sms-terms">SMS Message Terms</a>.</span>
			</label>
		</div>
		<div class="form-row form-row--full">
			<div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="{{ site.turnstileSiteKey }}" data-theme="light" data-size="normal"></div>
		</div>
		<div class="form-actions">
			<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Opt in</button>
		</div>
	</form>

	<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>

	<div id="sms-optin-result" class="alert alert-success" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite">
		<p><strong>You're subscribed.</strong> You'll receive a confirmation text shortly. Reply STOP at any time to opt out, or visit the <a href="/sms-unsubscribe/">unsubscribe page</a>.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section-block">
	<h2>What to expect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>A confirmation message will be sent to your number after you opt in.</li>
		<li>Messages may include product updates, account alerts, and promotional offers.</li>
		<li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out. You will receive one final confirmation and no further messages.</li>
		<li>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for support contact information.</li>
		<li>Standard message and data rates from your carrier may apply.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Need to opt out?</h2>
	<p>If you previously opted in and want to stop receiving messages, visit the <a href="/sms-unsubscribe/">SMS unsubscribe page</a> or reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from VoiceTel.</p>
</section>
